# Line endings: LF in the repo for everything text; the shell scripts must stay LF on checkout (bash),
# the Windows scripts CRLF (cmd, PowerShell).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
